Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.55,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}A march has several kinds of timing.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.43,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}行军还有几种时间。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.43,0:00:07.95,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}地图预览给计划，军队窗口给当前估计，当前首段有自己
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.55,0:00:06.76,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}The map preview gives a plan; the army window gives a current
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.76,0:00:10.76,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}estimate; the first leg has its own progress and remaining
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.95,0:00:13.25,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}的进度和剩余时量；军队真正到达，又是后来的结果。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.38,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}duration.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.38,0:00:13.69,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}Actual arrival is a later outcome.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.25,0:00:17.91,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}整条路线与第一段的数字不同，不一定互相矛盾。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.69,0:00:18.72,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}Different figures for the whole route and its first leg need not conflict.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.91,0:00:23.17,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}我们会把它们各自描述的范围标出来，再用实际位置和剩
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.72,0:00:22.99,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}We will label their scope, then verify arrival from the actual
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.99,0:00:27.81,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}position and remaining route, rather than making one date mean several
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.17,0:00:28.22,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}余路线核对到达，让一个日期不再承担几种不同意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.81,0:00:28.30,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}things.
